{"id":"657387","name":"凉拌双丝","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657387/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"200g"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米辣","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材准备好。","img":"images/657387/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜和黄瓜刮掉皮洗净。","img":"images/657387/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜切成丝。","img":"images/657387/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黄瓜切成丝放入胡萝卜一起，用盐抓匀腌出水分。","img":"images/657387/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小米辣切碎。","img":"images/657387/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入双丝中，加入橄榄油拌匀。","img":"images/657387/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒掉多余的水分，装盘。","img":"images/657387/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"即可。","img":"images/657387/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}